      \\"og:site_name\\": \\"n8n Blog\\",\\\\n      \\"og:type\\": \\"article\\",\\\\n      \\"description\\": \\"Step-by-step guide to building AI agents with code, frameworks like LangChain, or no-code tools like n8n for fast, flexible development. Learn now!\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:creator\\": \\"@ltd_mihai\\",\\\\n      \\"language\\": \\"en\\",\\\\n      \\"article:publisher\\": \\"https://www.facebook.com/n8nio\\",\\\\n      \\"article:published_time\\": \\"2025-04-24T16:45:20.000Z\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:label2\\": \\"Filed under\\",\\\\n      \\"article:tag\\": [\\\\n        \\"AI\\",\\\\n        \\"Tutorial\\"\\\\n      ],\\\\n      \\"publishedTime\\": \\"2025-04-24T16:45:20.000Z\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:title\\": \\"How To Build Your First AI Agent (+Free Workflow Template)\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:description\\": \\"Step-by-step guide to building AI agents with three practical approaches\\\\\\\\u2014coding from scratch for full control, leveraging powerful frameworks like LangChain or LlamaIndex for faster development, or using no-code tools like n8n for rapid prototyping and automation.\\",\\\\n      \\"twitter:image\\": \\"https://blog.n8n.io/content/images/size/w1200/2025/04/ai-2--1-.png\\",\\\\n      \\"title\\": \\"How To Build Your First AI Agent (+Free Workflow Template) \\\\\\\\u2013 n8n Blog\\",\\\\n      \\"ogImage\\": \\"https://blog.n8n.io/content/images/size/w1200/2025/04/ai-2--1-.png\\",\\\\n      \\"scrapeId\\": \\"6bd8719c-253c-4363-99c1-22e76e1e9f10\\",\\\\n      \\"sourceURL\\": \\"https://blog.n8n.io/how-to-build-ai-agent/\\",\\\\n      \\"url\\": \\"https://blog.n8n.io/how-to-build-ai-agent/\\",\\\\n      \\"statusCode\\": 200,\\\\n      \\"proxyUsed\\": \\"basic\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  }\\\\n]\') </scrape-webpage> </tool_result>"}', 'metadata': '{"assistant_message_id": "26020d90-7ed2-4042-9738-c5e8f5ca2aa4", "parsing_details": {"attributes": {".": "https://blog.n8n.io/how-to-build-ai-agent/"}, "elements": {}, "text_content": null, "roo